  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Multiplying&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> by <math><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math> and dividing&nbsp;<math><mo>&#8710;</mo></math> by <math><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Now, applying&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8596;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> becomes identical with <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
